content.text:
The degradation comes from two independent faults, both visible in the abnormal window and both reaching the user-facing `ts-ui-dashboard`.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-order-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_failure",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', time) m, attr_k8s_pod_name pod, MIN(value) mn, MAX(value) mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE metric='k8s.container.restarts' AND attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'ts-order-service%' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1", "claim": "ts-order-service pod restart counter is 1 throughout the abnormal window, versus 0 in the normal period."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT date_trunc('minute', time) m, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-order-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "ts-order-service server spans are absent for the first ~2 abnormal minutes, then resume at reduced volume."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, COUNT(*) n, MIN(message) ex FROM abnormal_logs WHERE message ILIKE '%Connection refused%' AND message ILIKE '%ts-order-service%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "ts-seat-service logs SEVERE errors: POST to ts-order-service /order/tickets failed with Connection refused."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "service": "ts-payment-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(quantile_cont(duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND span_name IN ('PaymentRepository.findByOrderId','SELECT Payment','PaymentController.pay') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "PaymentRepository.findByOrderId takes about 1.1-2.2 s while its child SQL span is only about 10-15 ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, ROUND(duration/1e6,1) ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-inside-payment-service' AND span_name='POST' AND trace_id IN (SELECT trace_id FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-payment-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server') LIMIT 5", "claim": "Inside-payment's outgoing POST to payment takes about 2.4 s when payment is slow."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, ROUND(AVG(value),3) avg_v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'ts-payment-service%' AND metric IN ('k8s.pod.cpu_limit_utilization','k8s.pod.memory_limit_utilization') GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Payment pod CPU and memory stay low (CPU ~0.1% of limit), so the slowdown is inside the method, not resource saturation."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-order-service", "to": "ts-seat-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND p.service_name='ts-seat-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Seat-service POST calls fail with Error status, 27 times, while left_tickets server spans return 500."}]},
    {"from": "ts-seat-service", "to": "ts-travel-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND c.service_name='ts-seat-service' AND p.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel-service calls to seat left_tickets return Error, and travel's trips/left spans fail with 500."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Route-plan calls to travel-service trips/left and trip_detail return 500 errors."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND p.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Travel-plan calls to route-plan cheapestRoute and minStopStations return 500 errors."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "UI dashboard calls to travel-plan travelPlan endpoints return 500 errors, reaching user requests."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.attr_status_code='Error' AND p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "UI dashboard calls to travel-service trips/left return 500 errors, which reach the user as 500 responses."}]},
    {"from": "ts-payment-service", "to": "ts-inside-payment-service", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, c.span_name, ROUND(quantile_cont(c.duration/1e6,0.5),1) p50_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-inside-payment-service' AND c.service_name='ts-payment-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Inside-payment's calls to payment service take about 2.3 s at p50 in the abnormal window."}]},
    {"from": "ts-inside-payment-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name parent_svc, c.service_name child_svc, ROUND(quantile_cont(c.duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms, COUNT(*) n FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-inside-payment-service' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "UI dashboard's calls to inside-payment slow to about 862 ms p95, up from about 107 ms in normal."}]}
  ]
}
```

